OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire schools told to improve
OL,4,Aor lose funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has threatened to
OL,7,Fwithdraw funding from three Yorkshire
OL,8,Fschools following poor Ofsted ratings.
OL,10,FThrybergh Academy in Rotherham, Enrich
OL,11,FAcademy in Wakefield and Beckfoot
OL,12,FThornton in Bradford all received
OL,13,Fwarnings from the Department for
OL,14,FEducation (DfE) after they were found
OL,15,Fto be in need of "significant
OL,16,Fimprovement".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
