OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire schools told to improve
OL,4,Aor lose funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe schools were given Ofsted's lowest
OL,7,Frating during their latest inspections
OL,8,Faccording to Alison Wilson, regional
OL,9,Fdirector for Yorkshire and the Humber,
OL,10,Fwith Beckfoot Thornton put into special
OL,11,Fmeasures.
OL,13,FIn a letter to John Winkley, chair of
OL,14,Ftrustees at Beckfoot Trust, Wilson said
OL,15,Fthere were fears for student and staff
OL,16,Fsafety at the academy trust's Thornton
OL,17,Fschool.
